{"ID":"20231225172511-qmufeie","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20231225172511-qmufeie","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231225172511-qmufeie\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231225172528-p9a3ubb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231225172757-49kme6t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231225172757-49kme6t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【地黄饮子】","type":"doc","updated":"20231225172757"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231225172528-p9a3ubb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231225172528-p9a3ubb"}},{"ID":"20231225172511-a0jnhdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231225172511-a0jnhdo","updated":"20231225172715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地黄饮子：干地黄(焙)，巴戟天(去心)，山茱萸(炒)，石斛(去根)，肉苁蓉(酒浸，切，焙)，附子(炮裂，去皮脐)，五味子(炒)，桂(去粗皮)，白茯苓(去黑皮)，麦门冬(去心焙)，菖蒲，远志 (去心)。上到上剉，如麻豆大。每服三钱匕，水一盏，加生姜三片，大枣二枚(擎破)，同煎七分，去滓，食前温服。方中以干地黄为主，用清水微煎为饮服，取其轻清之气，易为升降，迅达经络，流走四肢百骸，以交阴阳，故名“地黄饮子”。"}]},{"ID":"20231225172757-49kme6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231225172757-49kme6t"}}]}